.TH SIMORGH 1 "SimorghOS 0.0.1" "SimorghOS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
simorgh \- SimorghOS command hub (مرکز فرمان سیمرغ‌اواس)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B simorgh
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B simorgh
is the unified command line interface of SimorghOS. It wraps package
management (apt + Flathub), personalization (language, theme, calendar,
wallpaper), daily tools (screenshot, recording, clipboard) and a user
plugin system.
.SH SYSTEM COMMANDS
.TP
.B update
Full system upgrade: apt update + full-upgrade + flatpak update.
.TP
.BI install " pkg|app-id"
Install a package. Arguments that look like a Flatpak application id
(e.g. org.libreoffice.LibreOffice) are installed from Flathub;
anything else is installed with apt.
.TP
.BI remove " pkg|app-id"
Remove a package (Flatpak ids are uninstalled, others purged via apt).
.TP
.BI search " query"
Search both apt and Flathub.
.TP
.B restore
Open the Timeshift restore-point manager.
.TP
.B info
Print a system summary (fastfetch).
.SH PERSONALIZATION
.TP
.BI lang " en|fa"
Switch the interface language between English and Persian.
.TP
.BI theme " dark|lapis|light"
Switch the global theme (Hyprland, Waybar, Rofi, GTK, Qt, wallpaper).
.TP
.BI calendar " jalali|gregorian|both"
Choose the calendar shown by simorgh-jdate and the panel.
.TP
.BI wallpaper " [list|file]"
List or set the desktop wallpaper.
.TP
.B center
Open the Control Center menu (rofi).
.TP
.B store
Open the App Center (Flathub installer).
.SH TOOLS
.TP
.B date
Print today's date in the configured calendar (Jalali-aware).
.TP
.BR screenshot " [area]"
Save a screenshot (full screen, or a selected region with
.BR area ).
.TP
.BR record " start|stop"
Start / stop screen recording (wf-recorder, saved to ~/Videos).
.TP
.B clipboard
Pick an entry from the clipboard history (cliphist + rofi).
.SH PLUGINS
Any executable file placed in
.IR ~/.config/simorgh/plugins/ ,
.I /usr/local/share/simorgh/plugins/
or
.I /usr/share/simorgh/plugins/
automatically becomes a subcommand:
.BR "simorgh <name> [args]" .
.TP
.B plugins
List all currently installed plugins.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/simorgh/defaults
System-wide defaults (calendar, digits, theme).
.TP
.I ~/.config/simorgh/prefs
Per-user preferences.
.TP
.I ~/.config/simorgh/plugins/
Per-user plugin directory.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
simorgh install brave-browser
simorgh install org.libreoffice.LibreOffice
simorgh theme lapis
simorgh calendar jalali
simorgh lang fa
simorgh screenshot area
simorgh record start
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
simorgh-setup(1), timeshift(1), flatpak(1)
